Z||000000||Fast Richard||07-26-2001||10:04 PM||||We live in one of those progressive states that does not allow self serve gas. The attendant always hangs up the nozzle at about 3/4 full. He claims that it's full because the nozzle kicks off. If I really pester him, he can drip in another 3 gallons. Is this an inherent Fiero problem, or might I have a plugged vent or something? ||||reg||1
Z||000001||T-top Fiero||07-26-2001||10:11 PM||||My 84 SE is the same way. The nozzle will shut off with about 2 1/2 - 3 gallons to go before it is really full. The last few gallons have to be put in very slow. So you are not alone.||||reg||1
Z||000002||DecadenceR||07-26-2001||10:52 PM||||I haven't had that problem with my 84SE. Actualy, the guys in my state like to try to cram as much in as they can.||||reg||1
Z||000003||terryk||07-26-2001||11:17 PM||||I looked at the tank and there is a baffle box just after the inlet in the tank. I think it's to limit fuel traveling up the filler hose during acceleration. It seems the gas has to drain from that box into the main tank area so the dang thing triggers the pump nozzle. On both of my 86SE's I have to work to get it to fill completely otherwise it's about 2 gals short. Scares me when I them proceed to put 10.1 gallons in the tank.....||||reg||1
Z||000004||86SE||07-26-2001||11:52 PM||||I run it to empty (or just about) and can only fit in 7.7 before it clicks off.   But my fuel guage says its Full!! Sometimes a bit over full.||||reg||1
Z||000005||SilverFieroV6||07-27-2001||01:35 AM||||Im with Decadence  people in NJ try and stuff as much in as possiable.  Normally mine has no problems, and I run my tank down to just about empty.  Normally it takes 9 gal or just short of that.<BR>Sam<BR><P>------------------<BR>Gold 86 SE V6 4sp daily driver<BR>Silver 85 SE V6 auto ( actually running now)||||reg||1
Z||000006||GTMike||07-27-2001||02:05 AM||||i have the same problem  i figured there was some sort of baffal in it.   its a pain in the a$$  i can fit a little over 2 gallons after it clicks off  but it takes me like another 5 min to get it all in. ||||reg||1
